{"step_index":41,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:30:24Z","thinking":"Initial design considerations focus on visual appeal and accessibility. The app's background will feature the uploaded student artwork. A dark, semi-transparent overlay with a subtle gradient will be implemented to ensure high text contrast and readability, preserving visibility of the background image's elements.\n\n\nFocus shifted to specific UI element design, considering glassmorphism for cards, with glowing effects on the logo. Mobile and desktop headers will have distinct layouts with relevant actions and navigation elements. A splash screen is planned to display for a short duration with progress and dynamic messages.\n\n\nA splash screen animation sequence is planned to portray the student's academic struggle and preparation before transitioning to the login page. This will include humorous messages illustrating the challenges of college life. The login screen features a glassmorphic card with a logo and tagline. The user can either log in or proceed as a guest.\n\n\nThe home dashboard requires a personalized greeting and engaging content to maintain user interest. Real-time calculation and display of a survival score, along with humorous verdicts, aims to gamify the user experience. The inclusion of summary cards for key metrics allows easy navigation to relevant sections.\n\n\nA subject-wise attendance tracking mechanism is considered, including progress visualization, real-time advice, and quick action tools for attendance updates. A standalone simulator tool will allow attendance scenario planning.\n\nAssignment due dates and completion status will be displayed with real-time countdown badges, allowing for sorting. Realistic subjects will be prepopulated to enhance user experience.\n\n\nFocusing on the assignment display, I need to design the interface for filtering assignments by status and deadline, including actionable buttons for each assignment. I'm also planning the Canteen Status section, which involves a toggle for open/closed status, and a menu with an order calculator.\n\nThe Timetable UI will display the daily schedule, with the current day highlighted and an option to add new classes.\n\n\nThe timetable UI design needs enhancements, including class editing, deletion, and day-based filtering. An exam countdown feature is planned, integrating real-time tickers, urgency indicators, and actions for exam management.\nA \"Sleep or Study\" survival engine is designed, featuring interactive inputs to generate humorous, personalized AI advice based on student inputs.\n\n\nConsidering adding humorous reminders and a power nap timer to the app's functionality to support student productivity and well-being. This requires UI elements for input and visual feedback.\n\nFocusing on user profile management and settings, this section will include the ability to edit student details, toggle sound effects, reset to sample data, and logout with a humorous confirmation modal.\n\nDeveloping audio synthesis for all UI interactions, from button clicks to alarms, using a built-in sound engine. Audio will be toggleable in the settings, minimizing dependencies on external files.\n\nLocal storage needs to persist user data, including initialization with sample data on first launch and automatic backups. This ensures data integrity across sessions. The design must be responsive for both mobile and tablet displays.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Student Survival App 🎓 | Survive college. One deadline at a time. 😂</title>\n\n  <!-- Favicon using the uploaded Life of a Student artwork -->\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/jpeg\" href=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\">\n\n  <!-- Google Fonts: Outfit (modern display) & Plus Jakarta Sans (ultra clean readable body) -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      darkMode: 'class',\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          fontFamily: {\n            heading: ['Outfit', 'sans-serif'],\n            sans: ['\"Plus Jakarta Sans\"', 'sans-serif'],\n          },\n          colors: {\n            brand: {\n              50: '#eef2ff',\n              100: '#e0e7ff',\n              400: '#818cf8',\n              500: '#6366f1',\n              600: '#4f46e5',\n              700: '#4338ca',\n            },\n            accent: {\n              amber: '#f59e0b',\n              emerald: '#10b981',\n              rose: '#f43f5e',\n              cyan: '#06b6d4',\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n\n  <!-- Custom Styles for Glassmorphism, animations and background -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <!-- FULL SCREEN BACKGROUND: Uploaded \"Life of a Student\" Image -->\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-2] app-bg-image\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <!-- Dark translucent overlay to preserve contrast while keeping artwork recognizable -->\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1] app-bg-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <!-- ⏳ APP LOADING / SPLASH SCREEN (2-3 seconds with funny messages) -->\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"splash-screen\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 select-none bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl\">\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-sm flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n      <!-- Uploaded Image Logo with circular/rounded crop & glowing badge -->\n      <div class=\"relative mb-4 group\">\n        <div class=\"absolute -inset-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-rose-500 to-indigo-500 rounded-3xl blur-lg opacity-75 animate-pulse\"></div>\n        <div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 sm:w-32 sm:h-32 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/30 shadow-2xl bg-black\">\n          <img src=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\" alt=\"Life of a Student Logo\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\">\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg border border-white/20\">\n          v2.0 🔥\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight font-heading text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n        <span>🎓</span> Student Survival App\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-300 font-semibold mt-1 mb-5\">\n        “Loading your academic survival kit...”\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Dynamic Funny Student Messages with smooth fade -->\n      <div class=\"w-full min-h-[72px] flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 mb-5 shadow-inner\">\n        <p id=\"splash-quote\" class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-200 text-center leading-relaxed transition-opacity duration-300\">\n          “📚 Finding your motivation... ERROR 404.”\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Animated Progress Bar -->\n      <div class=\"w-full bg-white/15 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-2 p-0.5 relative shadow-inner\">\n        <div id=\"splash-progress-bar\" class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-rose-400 to-indigo-400 transition-all duration-100 ease-out\" style=\"width: 0%;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-300 font-mono font-bold mb-4\">\n        <span id=\"splash-status-text\">Preparing survival mode...</span>\n        <span id=\"splash-progress-percent\">0%</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <button onclick=\"App.skipSplash()\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-300 hover:text-white transition flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10\">\n        <span>Skip to App</span> &rarr;\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <!-- 🔐 1. LOGIN / WELCOME PAGE (Glassmorphism Card) -->\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"auth-screen\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-40 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-md glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-2xl shadow-2xl border border-white/20 text-white my-auto animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <!-- Glow accent behind card -->\n      <div class=\"absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-44 h-44 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-44 h-44 bg-amber-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Header with Logo -->\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n        <div class=\"inline-block relative mb-3\">\n          <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-indigo-400/50 shadow-xl mx-auto ring-4 ring-indigo-500/20\">\n            <img src=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\" alt=\"Life of a Student Logo\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 text-base\">🧑🎓</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black font-heading tracking-tight text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          🎓 Student Survival App\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-200 font-medium mt-1\">\n          “Survive college. One deadline at a time. 😂”\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Login Form -->\n      <form id=\"login-form\" onsubmit=\"App.handleLogin(event)\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1.5\">👤 Student Name</label>\n          <div class=\"relative\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"login-name\" placeholder=\"e.g. Aarav Sharma\" required\n              class=\"w-full pl-3.5 pr-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent transition\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1.5\">📧 College Email</label>\n          <div class=\"relative\">\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"login-email\" placeholder=\"e.g. aarav@college.edu\" required\n              class=\"w-full pl-3.5 pr-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent transition\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1.5 flex justify-between\">\n            <span>🔒 Password <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-normal\">(Optional)</span></span>\n            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-300\">No stress here! 😌</span>\n          </label>\n          <input type=\"password\" id=\"login-password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\"\n            class=\"w-full pl-3.5 pr-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent transition\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-300 pt-1\">\n          <label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"login-remember\" checked class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 bg-slate-800 border-white/20\">\n            <span>☑ Remember me</span>\n          </label>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-indigo-300\">Local save only 💾</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Submit Buttons -->\n        <div class=\"pt-2 space-y-2.5\">\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-indigo-700 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-indigo-600 text-white font-extrabold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/40 hover:shadow-indigo-600/60 active:scale-[0.98] transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n            <span>🚀 Enter Survival Mode</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.loginAsGuest()\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-slate-200 hover:text-white font-bold text-xs border border-white/15 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n            <span>🎒 Continue as Guest</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n\n      <!-- Footer Note -->\n      <p class=\"text-[11px] text-center text-slate-400 mt-5\">\n        🔒 All data is safely stored in your browser's localStorage. No server leaks your bunk records! 🤫\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <!-- MAIN APP WRAPPER (Shown after login) -->\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"main-app\" class=\"hidden flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n    <!-- ======================================================== -->\n    <!-- TOP NAVIGATION / HEADER -->\n    <!-- ======================================================== -->\n    <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 glass-nav border-b border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 sm:h-20 flex items-center justify-between\">\n        \n        <!-- Left: App Logo & Title -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"App.navigate('home')\">\n          <!-- Circular / Rounded-square crop of uploaded Life of a Student artwork -->\n          <div class=\"relative w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-indigo-400/40 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20 flex-shrink-0\">\n            <img src=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\" alt=\"Student Survival App\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n              <h1 class=\"font-heading font-black text-base sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span>🎓</span> Student Survival App\n              </h1>\n              <span class=\"hidden sm:inline-block bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-400/30\">\n                PRO 🚀\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-indigo-200 font-medium line-clamp-1\">\n              “Because college is already hard enough 😭”\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center: Desktop Navigation Bar -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-900/60 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-inner\">\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('home')\" data-tab=\"home\" class=\"nav-btn active px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>🏠</span> Home\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('attendance')\" data-tab=\"attendance\" class=\"nav-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>📊</span> Attendance\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('assignments')\" data-tab=\"assignments\" class=\"nav-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>📝</span> Assignments\n            <span id=\"badge-assignments-count\" class=\"ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-rose-500 text-white rounded-full text-[10px] font-black\">3</span>\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('canteen')\" data-tab=\"canteen\" class=\"nav-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>🍔</span> Canteen\n            <span id=\"header-canteen-pill\" class=\"ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.2 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold\">OPEN</span>\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('timetable')\" data-tab=\"timetable\" class=\"nav-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>📅</span> Timetable\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.navigate('exams')\" data-tab=\"exams\" class=\"nav-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span>⏳</span> Exams\n          </button>\n          <button onclick=\"App.openSleepStudyModal()\" class=\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-rose-500 text-white hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-rose-400 shadow-md transition flex items-center gap-1\">\n            <span>😂</span> Sleep or Study?\n          </button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Right: Profile, Survival Score & Sound -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\">\n          <!-- Survival Score Chip (Desktop) -->\n          <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs\">🎓 Survival:</span>\n            <span id=\"header-survival-score\" class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-300\">82/100</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Sound Mute/Unmute Toggle -->\n          <button onclick=\"App.toggleSound()\" id=\"sound-toggle-btn\" title=\"Toggle Sound FX\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/15 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition text-xs\">\n            🔊\n          </button>\n\n          <!-- User Profile Dropdown Button -->\n          <button onclick=\"App.openProfileModal()\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-1.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/15 transition text-left\">\n            <div class=\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 to-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-white text-xs shadow\">\n              <span id=\"header-avatar-initials\">AS</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden sm:block\">\n              <div id=\"header-user-name\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight\">Aarav Sharma</div>\n              <div id=\"header-user-status\" class=\"text-[10px] text-indigo-300\">Surviving Semester 🔥</div>\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- ======================================================== -->\n    <!-- CONTENT PAGES CONTAINER -->\n    <!-- ======================================================== -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 pb-24 md:pb-12\">\n\n      <!-- ====================================================== -->\n      <!-- 🏠 PAGE 1: HOME DASHBOARD -->\n      <!-- ====================================================== -->\n      <section id=\"page-home\" class=\"page-section space-y-6 animate-fade-in\">\n        \n        <!-- Welcome Hero Greeting & Quote Banner -->\n        <div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/15 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-400/30 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-bold mb-3\">\n                <span>🔥 Semester Survival Active</span>\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping\"></span>\n              </div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-heading tracking-tight text-white\">\n                Hey <span id=\"dash-greeting-name\" class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-300 via-rose-300 to-indigo-300\">Student</span>! 👋\n              </h2>\n              <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium\">\n                Ready to survive today? Your assignments are waiting (and praying). 😂\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- Daily Student Quote -->\n              <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 bg-slate-900/60 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-3 max-w-xl\">\n                <span class=\"text-xl\">💡</span>\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                  <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-amber-400\">Daily Student Wisdom</div>\n                  <p id=\"dash-daily-quote\" class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 italic\">\n                    “Attendance is temporary. Backlogs are forever.”\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <button onclick=\"App.shuffleQuote()\" title=\"Shuffle Quote\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-xs text-white transition active:rotate-180\">\n                  🎲\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Survival Score Dial / Radial Card -->\n            <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/15 backdrop-blur-md text-center min-w-[190px]\">\n              <div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <!-- Circular SVG Progress -->\n                <svg class=\"w-full h-full transform -rotate-90\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"8\" class=\"text-white/10\" fill=\"transparent\" />\n                  <circle id=\"dash-score-circle\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"8\"\n                    class=\"text-indigo-400 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out\"\n                    stroke-dasharray=\"251.2\"\n                    stroke-dashoffset=\"45\"\n                    stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n                    fill=\"transparent\" />\n                </svg>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n                  <span id=\"dash-survival-score-num\" class=\"text-2xl font-black font-heading text-white\">82</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase\">/ 100</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-black text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span>🎓 Survival Score</span>\n              </div>\n              <p id=\"dash-survival-label\" class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium\">Safe from detention 😎</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Dashboard 5 Cards Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\">\n          \n          <!-- Card 1: 📊 Attendance Status -->\n          <div onclick=\"App.navigate('attendance')\" class=\"glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 border border-white/15 hover:border-indigo-400/50 transition cursor-pointer group shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-2xl p-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300\">📊</span>\n                <div>\n                  <h3 class=\"font-heading font-black text-sm text-white\">Attendance Health</h3>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-medium\">Minimum target: 75%</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <span id=\"dash-attendance-badge\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-black bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                🟢 Safe\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"my-3\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1.5\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium\">Overall Attendance</span>\n                <span id=\"dash-attendance-percent\" class=\"text-2xl font-black font-heading text-white\">78%</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"w-full bg-white/10 h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                <div id=\"dash-attendance-bar\" class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-emerald-400 rounded-full transition-all duration-700\" style=\"width: 78%;\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <p id=\"dash-attendance-advice\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-2\">\n       