{"step_index":43,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:31:38Z","thinking":"Reviewing the styling requirements, the primary focus is on integrating the uploaded image as a non-distorted, full-screen background. This involves `cover` sizing, centered positioning, and potentially fixed attachment for supported browsers. A dark overlay is required to ensure readability, along with applying glassmorphism to card elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ========================================================\n   STUDENT SURVIVAL APP 🎓 — CUSTOM STYLESHEET\n   Glassmorphism + Responsive Design + \"Life of a Student\" Theme\n======================================================== */\n\n/* Root Font & Base Reset */\n:root {\n  --primary-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);\n  --accent-amber: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);\n  --glass-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);\n  --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  background-color: #030712;\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4, .font-heading {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   🖼️ BACKGROUND VISUAL: Uploaded \"Life of a Student\" Artwork\n======================================================== */\n.app-bg-image {\n  background-image: url('assets/life-of-a-student.jpg');\n  background-repeat: no-repeat;\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center center;\n  background-attachment: fixed;\n  filter: contrast(1.08) brightness(0.92);\n  transition: transform 0.5s ease;\n}\n\n/* On mobile screens, smartly center and focus on the notebook title and cartoon */\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .app-bg-image {\n    background-position: center 20%;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-attachment: scroll; /* smooth scroll on mobile browsers */\n  }\n}\n\n/* Dark Translucent Overlay to ensure AAA contrast & readability */\n.app-bg-overlay {\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78) 0%, rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.88) 100%);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(2px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   GLASSMORPHISM CARDS & PANELS\n======================================================== */\n.glass-card {\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) inset;\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.glass-card:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n  box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 15px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);\n}\n\n.glass-nav {\n  background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.82);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   NAVIGATION & ACTIVE STATES\n======================================================== */\n.nav-btn {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-btn:hover {\n  color: #ffffff;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n.nav-btn.active {\n  color: #ffffff;\n  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.85);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);\n}\n\n.mobile-nav-btn {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.mobile-nav-btn.active {\n  color: #818cf8;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.mobile-nav-btn.active span:first-child {\n  transform: scale(1.18);\n  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.6));\n}\n\n.timetable-day-btn {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.timetable-day-btn.active {\n  background: #0891b2;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-color: #06b6d4;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);\n}\n\n.assign-filter-btn {\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.assign-filter-btn.active {\n  background: #4f46e5 !important;\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  border-color: #6366f1;\n}\n\n.brain-btn.active {\n  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25) !important;\n  border-color: #818cf8 !important;\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   ANIMATIONS & KEYFRAMES\n======================================================== */\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(8px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-fade-in {\n  animation: fadeIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes bounceSubtle {\n  0%, 100% {\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-bounce-subtle {\n  animation: bounceSubtle 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes floatSlow {\n  0%, 100% {\n    transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  50% {\n    transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(1deg);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-float {\n  animation: floatSlow 4s infinite ease-in-out;\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   CUSTOM SCROLLBAR\n======================================================== */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n}\n\n.scrollbar-none::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n.scrollbar-none {\n  -ms-overflow-style: none;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n\n/* ========================================================\n   MOBILE TOUCH FRIENDLINESS\n======================================================== */\nbutton, input, select, a {\n  touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n/* Smooth Pulse ring */\n.ring-pulse {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.7);\n  animation: pulse-ring 2s infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse-ring {\n  0% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.7);\n  }\n  70% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0);\n  }\n  100% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(99, 102, 241, 0);\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Custom stylesheet with dark glassmorphism, responsive cover background with uploaded Life of a Student artwork, and smooth animations.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\student-survival-app\\styles.css","toolAction":"Writing styles.css","toolSummary":"Create styles.css for Student Survival App"}}]}
